\par    
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-6 \cellx7015\cellx7795\cellx11415\pard\intbl \{bmc bm14.bmp\}\f6\b\fs24  Click\plain\f6\b\fs24 {\v CLICK@Sem.HLP}\plain\f6\fs24  on\b  Save As\plain\f6\fs24  in the \b File\plain\f6\fs24  Menu.\f7\fs20 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \f6\fs24 \{bmc bm14.bmp\} Enter the \b file name\plain\f6\fs24  without extension. The extension is automatically added.\f7\fs20 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \f6\fs24 \{bmc bm14.bmp\} \b OK\plain\f6\fs24  saves the file in the User Directory.\f7\fs20 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \f6\fs24 \{bmc bm14.bmp\} \b Cancel\plain\f6\fs24  terminates without saving.\f7\fs20 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \f6\fs24 \{bmc bm14.bmp\} The window is closed with \{bmc bm15.bmp\} (equals Cancel).\cell\pard \pard\intbl \cell\pard \pard\intbl \f7\fs20 
