\b\fs36\cf1 Stage Limits
\par \pard\tx355 \plain\fs24 
\par \pard\tx355 This panel allows to limit the range of travel for each motorised axis of the stage individually.
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 \{bmc bm2.bmp\}\tab Select \b Tools\plain\fs24  with \b <ALT + T>\plain\fs24  from the \uldb \b Menu Bar\plain\b\fs24 {\v 8ZP0K4@Sem.HLP} \plain\fs24 , then \ul click\plain\fs24 {\v CLICK@Sem.HLP} on \b Goto Panel \plain\fs24 and select \b Stage Limits\plain\fs24  panel from the list.
\par 
\par \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab Click on the \uldb \b SEM Control Stage\plain\b\fs24 {\v KH.ZCT@TabMgr.HLP}\plain\fs24  tab with the right button, then select \b Stage Limits\plain\fs24  from the menu.
\par    
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-6 \cellx7585\cellx8085\cellx13115\pard\intbl\tx355 \{bmc bm4.bmp\}\tab Click on a \b Limit\plain\fs24  field to open the parameter input dialog.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab Click on a \b Limit\plain\fs24  field with the right mouse button to open a
\par\intbl  \uldb \b Predefined List\plain\b\fs24 {\v 6WI9IQ@Sem.HLP} \plain\fs24 dialog.
\par\intbl 
