\par \f6 This function deletes the currently highlighted list box entry from the Stage Points List.\f7\fs20 
\par 
\par \f6\fs24 If you have the Supervisor Privilege you may delete stage points with \b Global Labels\plain\f6\fs24 . They are preceded with a \b $\plain\f6\fs24 -character.\f2 
\par \f6 This Global Label position is independent of the Users Directory. So this position is available to all users. \f2 
\par \f6 If you do not have the privilege an error warning pops up:\f2 
\par 
\par \pard\tx355 \f6 \tab \tab \{bmc bm20.bmp\}\f2 
\par 
\par \f6 \{bmc bm6.bmp\}  If you delete a Global Label you delete it \b for all users\plain\f6\fs24 .\f2 
\par 
\par \f6 \{bmc bm8.bmp\}\tab \f2 Deleting a label \b M_nnn\plain\fs24  will cause other labels \b M_nnn\plain\fs24  following to be renumbered.
\par \page
