\b\fs36\cf1 Stage Points List On Goto
\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par When the stage is moved from the stage points list you can select whether Working Distance and Magnification are to be changed accordingly..
\par    
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-6 \cellx7015\cellx7795\cellx10565\pard\intbl\tx355 \{bmc bm4.bmp\}\tab \ul Click\plain\fs24 {\v CLICK@Sem.HLP} on \b On Goto\plain\fs24  to open the menu.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm14.bmp\} \f6 If \b Set Magnification\plain\f6\fs24  is selected \{bmc bm1.bmp\} then whenever the stage is moved to a saved position the magnification is set to the stored value.\f2 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm14.bmp\} \f6 If \b Set Working Distance\plain\f6\fs24  is selected \{bmc bm1.bmp\} then whenever the stage is moved to a saved position the \ul working distance\plain\f6\fs24 {\v 1YCGPIR@Sem.HLP} is set to the stored value.\f2 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \f6 \{bmc bm14.bmp\}\f2  \f6 If \b Move XY Only\plain\f6\fs24  is selected \{bmc bm1.bmp\} then whenever the stage is moved to a saved position all axes except XY remain unchanged.\f2 
\par\intbl \f6\b NOTE:\plain\f6\fs24  This setting is ignored for \ul global labels\plain\f6\fs24 {\v Global_Labels}\f2 
\par\intbl \cell\pard \pard\intbl\tx355 \cell\pard \pard\intbl\tx355 
\par\intbl 
