{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Touch Alarm}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Touch_Alarm}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 Touch Alarm
\par \pard \plain\fs24 If the stage touches the chamber, detectors etc an audible warning and on-screen message is given. 
\par Movement is stopped and is only possible in the reverse direction until the alarm is cleared.
\par 
\par It is advisable to use \uldb \b protected Z\plain\b\fs24 {\v K8LPPZ@tabmgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  mode to minimise the risk of a touch.
\par 
\par Note: When the stage is near the \uldb $Exchange\plain\fs24 {\v _Exchange} position the touch alarm is disabled.
\par 
\par 
